WEBVTT

00:25:29.365 --> 00:25:30.515
to behave.

00:25:30.539 --> 00:25:33.413
This is probably a terribly
unpopular thing to say,

00:25:33.437 --> 00:25:36.783
but it's possible that there's really
bad tendencies in most people,

00:25:36.807 --> 00:25:41.569
and you actually need a level
of knowing that you are being seen.

00:25:41.593 --> 00:25:43.593
That's always what's happened, you know --

00:25:43.617 --> 00:25:46.434
human social systems have been
this trade-off between ...

00:25:46.458 --> 00:25:50.878
There have to be systems for people
to punish freeloaders,

00:25:50.902 --> 00:25:52.950
or human systems break down.

00:25:53.291 --> 00:25:55.601
With the gradual decline of religion,

00:25:55.625 --> 00:25:59.133
part of me wanders whether
the future we all have in some way

00:25:59.157 --> 00:26:01.431
is just inevitably going to involve